|description = '''Houkago no Aitsu''' ('''放課後のあいつ'''), lit. Afterschool Boy is a male {{NNDict|Utaite}} who has only started in late 2013 and mainly covers VOCALOID originals.

Houkago no Aitsu has a gentle and clear, but strong and expressive voice in the higher ranges, which is said to be "sweet [and] induces sleep".<sup>[http://oneokrock0130.wix.com/uttattemita#!houkago/c1jo3]</sup> He also has a strong vibrato.

He likes to sing freely, and is said to be good at {{NNDict|serifu}}.

During namahousous, he likes to sing songs or play games.

Houkago no Aitsu shares a [http://oneokrock0130.wix.com/uttattemita homepage] with 4 other utaite, namely [[Rally]], [[Risru]], [[Umechazuke]] and [[Marestera]].
